  (text "VREF nominal 1.65 V; IPROPI 1500 uA/A and 3.3k give Itrip approx 0.333 A.\nProvisional limit only: characterize accuracy at 5 V and low pulse currents. No continuous hold drive.\nIN1/IN2 are hardware-gated by ACT_DRIVE_EN; switched ACT_5V has reverse blocking and a local clamp.\nCurrent feedback is sampled directly; review settling/blanking before adding any filter to IPROPI."
    (at 20 248 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "42a9ac7d-db70-5e70-b4bc-b42fb76c7721"))
